<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1,viewport-fit=cover">
<title>Dinner Planner</title>
<meta name="robots" content="noindex">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fredoka:wght@500;600;700&family=Nunito:wght@500;700;800&display=swap">
<style>
/* Layout: one bold column. Each night is a big colored card owned by one family member; tabs for Week, Groceries, Allergies. */
:root {
  --bg: #f3f6ff;
  --surface: #ffffff;
  --fg: #16182e;
  --muted: #5a5f80;
  --line: #dfe4f5;
  --ink: #16182e;
  --mon: #ff5a5f; --tue: #ff9f1c; --wed: #ffcd3c; --thu: #2ec4b6; --fri: #3a86ff; --sat: #8f4dff; --sun: #ff4fa3;
  --ok: #129a5a; --ok-soft: #dcf6e8;
  --warn: #8a5300; --warn-soft: #fff1d1;
  --danger: #c4231c; --danger-soft: #ffe3e0;
  --plate: #ffffff; --plate-rim: #e6e9f7; --art-bg: #fff4dc;
  --font-display: "Fredoka", "Arial Rounded MT Bold", "Trebuchet MS", system-ui, sans-serif;
  --font-body: "Nunito", system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
}
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) { :root:not([data-theme="light"]) {
  --bg: #12142a; --surface: #1d2040; --fg: #f1f2ff; --muted: #a9adcf; --line: #30345e;
  --ok: #4fd99a; --ok-soft: #173a2b; --warn: #ffc966; --warn-soft: #3a2c10; --danger: #ff8d85; --danger-soft: #42201e; --plate: #f4f1ea; --plate-rim: #3a3f70; --art-bg: #262a52; color-scheme: dark } }
:root[data-theme="dark"] {
  --bg: #12142a; --surface: #1d2040; --fg: #f1f2ff; --muted: #a9adcf; --line: #30345e;
  --ok: #4fd99a; --ok-soft: #173a2b; --warn: #ffc966; --warn-soft: #3a2c10; --danger: #ff8d85; --danger-soft: #42201e; --plate: #f4f1ea; --plate-rim: #3a3f70; --art-bg: #262a52; color-scheme: dark }

body { background: var(--bg); color: var(--fg); font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.45; font-weight: 500; }
.wrap { max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto; padding-left: max(16px, env(safe-area-inset-left, 0px)); padding-right: max(16px, env(safe-area-inset-right, 0px)); padding-block: 18px 56px; }
h1, h2, h3 { font-family: var(--font-display); margin: 0; text-wrap: balance; }
button, select { font: inherit; }
:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--fri); outline-offset: 2px; }
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) { .pop { transition: transform .12s ease; } .pop:active { transform: scale(.97); } }

/* Header */
.brand { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 12px; justify-content: space-between; }
.logo { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
.plate { width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 50%; background: conic-gradient(var(--mon) 0 14%, var(--tue) 0 28%, var(--wed) 0 43%, var(--thu) 0 57%, var(--fri) 0 71%, var(--sat) 0 86%, var(--sun) 0); position: relative; flex: none; }
.plate::after { content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 9px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--bg); }
h1 { font-size: 2.1rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
.tag { color: var(--muted); font-weight: 700; margin: 4px 0 0; }
.safe { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; background: var(--ok-soft); color: var(--ok); font-weight: 800; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 999px; font-size: .85rem; }
.safe::before { content: ""; width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--ok); }
.sync { font-size: .8rem; color: var(--muted); }

/* Tabs */
body::before { content: ""; position: fixed; inset: 0 0 auto; height: env(safe-area-inset-top, 0px); z-index: 10; background: var(--bg); }
nav.tabs { position: sticky; top: env(safe-area-inset-top, 0px); z-index: 5; background: var(--bg); display: flex; gap: 8px; padding-block: 12px; margin-top: 10px; }
nav.tabs button { flex: 1; border: 3px solid var(--ink); background: var(--surface); color: var(--fg); padding: 10px 6px; border-radius: 14px; font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.05rem; cursor: pointer; box-shadow: 0 4px 0 var(--ink); }
nav.tabs button[aria-selected="true"] { background: var(--wed); color: var(--ink); }
:root[data-theme="dark"] nav.tabs button, :root[data-theme="dark"] .btn { border-color: var(--line); box-shadow: 0 4px 0 #000; }
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) { :root:not([data-theme="light"]) nav.tabs button, :root:not([data-theme="light"]) .btn { border-color: var(--line); box-shadow: 0 4px 0 #000; } }
.count { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }

section.view { display: grid; gap: 16px; padding-top: 14px; }
.bar { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; }
.progress { font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.1rem; }
.btn { border: 3px solid var(--ink); background: var(--surface); color: var(--fg); padding: 8px 16px; border-radius: 12px; cursor: pointer; font-weight: 800; box-shadow: 0 3px 0 var(--ink); }
.btn.go { background: var(--ok); color: #fff; }
.btn.small { padding: 5px 12px; font-size: .88rem; box-shadow: 0 2px 0 var(--ink); border-width: 2px; }
.btn:disabled { opacity: .5; cursor: default; }

/* Night card */
.nights { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: 16px; }
.night { background: var(--surface); border-radius: 20px; overflow: hidden; border: 3px solid var(--day); }
.night-top { background: var(--day); color: var(--day-ink); padding: 10px 16px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 8px; }
.dayname { font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 1.1; }
.owner { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-weight: 800; }
.owner select { border: 2px solid currentColor; background: transparent; color: inherit; border-radius: 999px; padding: 3px 10px; font-weight: 800; cursor: pointer; }
.owner select option { color: #16182e; background: #fff; }
.night-body { padding: 14px 16px 16px; display: grid; gap: 12px; }
.prompt { font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.1rem; }
.cuisines { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; }
.cz { border: 2px solid var(--line); background: var(--bg); color: var(--fg); border-radius: 999px; padding: 6px 14px; font-weight: 800; cursor: pointer; }
.cz[aria-pressed="true"] { background: var(--day); color: var(--day-ink); border-color: var(--day); }
.options { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(190px, 1fr)); gap: 10px; }
.opt { text-align: left; border: 3px solid var(--line); background: var(--bg); color: var(--fg); border-radius: 16px; padding: 12px 14px; cursor: pointer; display: grid; gap: 4px; min-width: 0; }
.opt:hover { border-color: var(--day); }
.opt .on { font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.15rem; line-height: 1.2; }
.opt .od { color: var(--muted); font-size: .88rem; }
.opt .ot { font-size: .8rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--muted); }
.newbadge { display: inline-block; background: var(--sat); color: #fff; font-size: .72rem; font-weight: 800; padding: 1px 8px; border-radius: 999px; margin-bottom: 2px; justify-self: start; }
.row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; align-items: center; }
.chosen { display: grid; gap: 6px; }
.chosen .cname { font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.6rem; line-height: 1.15; }
.chosen .meta { color: var(--muted); font-weight: 700; }
.side { background: var(--ok-soft); color: var(--ok); font-weight: 700; border-radius: 10px; padding: 6px 10px; font-size: .88rem; }
.note { background: var(--warn-soft); color: var(--warn); border-radius: 10px; padding: 6px 10px; font-size: .88rem; font-weight: 700; }
.err { background: var(--danger-soft); color: var(--danger); border-radius: 10px; padding: 6px 10px; font-size: .88rem; font-weight: 700; }
details { background: var(--bg); border-radius: 12px; padding: 8px 12px; }
details summary { cursor: pointer; font-weight: 800; }
details h4 { margin: 10px 0 4px; font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 600; }
details ul, details ol { margin: 0; padding-left: 1.3rem; }
details li { margin: 2px 0; }
.skipped .chosen .cname { color: var(--muted); }

/* Ready banner */
.ready { background: var(--ok); color: #fff; border-radius: 18px; padding: 14px 18px; display: grid; gap: 4px; }
.ready h2 { font-size: 1.3rem; }
.ready p { margin: 0; font-weight: 700; }

/* Groceries */
.aisle { display: grid; gap: 8px; }
.aisle h3 { font-size: 1.15rem; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
.aisle h3::before { content: ""; width: 14px; height: 14px; border-radius: 4px; background: var(--ac); }
.items { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; background: var(--surface); border-radius: 16px; border: 2px solid var(--line); }
.item { display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto 1fr auto; gap: 12px; align-items: start; padding: 12px 14px; border-top: 2px solid var(--line); }
.item:first-child { border-top: 0; }
.item input { width: 24px; height: 24px; margin-top: 1px; accent-color: var(--ok); }
.item label { min-width: 0; cursor: pointer; }
.item .name { font-weight: 800; }
.item .qty { color: var(--muted); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; font-weight: 700; }
.item .for { display: block; color: var(--muted); font-size: .8rem; }
.item.done .name { text-decoration: line-through; color: var(--muted); }
.flag { display: block; color: var(--warn); font-size: .82rem; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 2px; }
.amz { font-size: .82rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--fri); white-space: nowrap; padding-top: 2px; }
textarea.copybox { width: 100%; min-height: 160px; font: .85rem/1.4 ui-monospace, monospace; background: var(--surface); color: var(--fg); border: 2px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; padding: 8px; box-sizing: border-box; }
.fine { font-size: .85rem; color: var(--muted); margin: 0; }

/* Allergies */
.card { background: var(--surface); border-radius: 18px; padding: 14px 16px; display: grid; gap: 10px; border: 3px solid var(--pc, var(--line)); }
.card h2 { font-size: 1.35rem; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
.dot { width: 18px; height: 18px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--pc); flex: none; }
.tablewrap { overflow-x: auto; }
table.allergy { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: .92rem; }
table.allergy th, table.allergy td { text-align: left; padding: 8px 6px; border-top: 2px solid var(--line); vertical-align: top; }
table.allergy th { color: var(--muted); font-size: .78rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .06em; border-top: 0; }
.sev { font-weight: 800; white-space: nowrap; }
.sev.high { color: var(--danger); } .sev.mid { color: var(--warn); } .sev.ok { color: var(--ok); }
.hs { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; font-weight: 800; font-size: .8rem; padding: 2px 10px; border-radius: 999px; justify-self: start; }
.hs.great { background: var(--ok-soft); color: var(--ok); }
.hs.good { background: var(--warn-soft); color: var(--warn); }
.hs.treat { background: var(--danger-soft); color: var(--danger); }
.why { color: var(--muted); font-size: .82rem; font-weight: 700; }
.health { background: var(--surface); border-radius: 20px; border: 3px solid var(--thu); padding: 14px 16px; display: grid; gap: 12px; }
.health-top { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 14px; }
.big { font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 700; font-size: 2.6rem; line-height: 1; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
.big small { font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--muted); }
.meter { flex: 1; min-width: 160px; height: 16px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--bg); overflow: hidden; border: 2px solid var(--line); }
.meter span { display: block; height: 100%; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--ok); }
.checks { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr)); gap: 8px; list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
.checks li { border-radius: 12px; padding: 8px 12px; font-weight: 800; font-size: .9rem; display: grid; gap: 2px; }
.checks li.okc { background: var(--ok-soft); color: var(--ok); }
.checks li.warnc { background: var(--warn-soft); color: var(--warn); }
.checks li span { font-weight: 600; font-size: .8rem; }
.storebar { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; align-items: center; background: var(--surface); border: 2px solid var(--line); border-radius: 16px; padding: 10px 14px; }
.storebar select { border: 2px solid var(--line); border-radius: 10px; padding: 6px 10px; background: var(--bg); color: var(--fg); font-weight: 800; }
.storebar label { font-weight: 800; display: inline-flex; gap: 8px; align-items: center; }
.storehead { font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.5rem; margin-top: 6px; }
.art { display: block; width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 200 / 130; border-radius: 12px; background: var(--art-bg); object-fit: cover; max-width: 100%; }
.chosen .art { max-width: 360px; }
.photo-row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; align-items: center; }
.photo-row input { max-width: 100%; font-size: .85rem; }
.toast { position: fixed; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); bottom: calc(18px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px)); background: var(--ink); color: #fff; padding: 10px 18px; border-radius: 12px; font-weight: 800; z-index: 20; }
:root { padding-top: env(safe-area-inset-top, 0px); padding-bottom: env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px); }
body { margin: 0; }
img { max-width: 100%; }
[hidden] { display: none !important; }
.who { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; align-items: center; margin-top: 10px; }
.who b { font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.05rem; }
.who button { border: 3px solid var(--pc); background: var(--surface); color: var(--fg); border-radius: 999px; padding: 6px 14px; font-weight: 800; cursor: pointer; }
.who button[aria-pressed="true"] { background: var(--pc); color: #16182e; }
figure.pic { margin: 0; display: grid; gap: 3px; }
.credit { font-size: .7rem; color: var(--muted); }
.credit a { color: inherit; }
.credits { font-size: .8rem; color: var(--muted); }
.credits li { margin: 2px 0; }
.setup { background: var(--surface); border: 3px solid var(--fri); border-radius: 20px; padding: 18px; display: grid; gap: 12px; margin-top: 16px; }
.setup h2 { font-size: 1.5rem; }
.share { background: var(--surface); border: 3px dashed var(--fri); border-radius: 18px; padding: 12px 16px; display: grid; gap: 8px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="wrap">
  <header>
    <div class="brand">
      <div class="logo"><div class="plate" aria-hidden="true"></div><div><h1>Dinner Planner</h1></div></div>
      <span class="safe">Every dish is safe for Greyson and Jet</span>
    </div>
    <p class="tag" id="weeklabel">Pick dinners for the week</p>
    <div class="who" id="who"></div>
    <span class="sync" id="sync">Connecting…</span>
  </header>

  <section class="setup" id="setup" hidden>
    <h2>Set up your family's Dinner Planner</h2>
    <p class="fine" style="font-size:1rem">This creates your family's private plan and a link to share. Anyone with the link can pick dinners, so only send it to family.</p>
    <div class="row"><button class="btn go pop" id="create">Create our family plan</button></div>
  </section>

  <nav class="tabs" role="tablist" id="tabs">
    <button class="pop" role="tab" aria-selected="true" data-view="plan">Pick dinners</button>
    <button class="pop" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-view="list">Groceries <span class="count" id="list-count"></span></button>
    <button class="pop" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-view="allergy">Allergies</button>
  </nav>

  <section class="view" id="view-plan">
    <div class="bar">
      <span class="progress" id="progress"></span>
      <div class="row">
        <button class="btn go pop" id="done">Week's picked</button>
        <button class="btn small pop" id="newweek">Start a new week</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="ready" id="ready" hidden>
      <h2>The week is picked</h2>
      <p>The shopping list is ready on the Groceries tab.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="note" id="confirm-new" hidden>
      Start over? This clears every night's pick and the grocery ticks. Dishes you picked this week will show up less often next week.
      <div class="row" style="margin-top:8px"><button class="btn small pop" id="confirm-yes">Yes, start a new week</button><button class="btn small pop" id="confirm-no">Keep this week</button></div>
    </div>
    <div class="health" id="health"></div>
    <ol class="nights" id="nights"></ol>
    <div class="share" id="sharebox" hidden>
      <b>Share with the family</b>
      <p class="fine">Send this link to Mom, Greyson, Isla and anyone else who picks. It opens straight into your family's week.</p>
      <div class="row"><button class="btn small pop" id="sharebtn">Copy the family link</button></div>
      <textarea class="copybox" id="sharetext" readonly hidden style="min-height:60px"></textarea>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="view" id="view-list" hidden>
    <div class="bar">
      <span class="progress">Shopping list for 6</span>
      <div class="row"><button class="btn go pop" id="copy">Copy list</button><button class="btn small pop" id="reset">Clear ticks</button></div>
    </div>
    <div class="storebar">
      <label for="store">Shop at <select id="store"></select></label>
      <label for="costco"><input type="checkbox" id="costco"> Meat, rice and oils from Costco</label>
    </div>
    <p class="fine">Built from the dinners you picked, in walking order: produce first, cold and frozen last. Tick items as they go in the cart. Yellow notes mean brands differ, so read the label before buying.</p>
    <p class="note" id="storenote" hidden></p>
    <div id="copy-fallback" hidden><textarea class="copybox" id="copy-text" readonly></textarea></div>
    <div id="aisles" style="display:grid;gap:18px"></div>
  </section>

  <section class="view" id="view-allergy" hidden>
    <details class="card"><summary>Photo credits</summary><ul class="credits" id="credits"></ul><p class="fine">Dish photos come from Wikipedia and are used under their free licenses. They show a typical version of each dish, which may include cheese, egg or other ingredients our recipes leave out.</p></details>
    <div class="card" style="--pc: var(--thu)">
      <h2><span class="dot"></span>Greyson, 16</h2>
      <div class="tablewrap"><table class="allergy">
        <thead><tr><th>Allergen</th><th>Reaction</th><th>Hides in</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>Fish</td><td class="sev high">Life-threatening</td><td>Fish sauce, Worcestershire, dashi, most kimchi, Caesar dressing, some BBQ sauces</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Eggs</td><td class="sev high">Severe</td><td>Mayo, egg noodles, batters and breading, most baked goods, pancake mixes</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Milk</td><td class="sev high">Severe</td><td>Butter, whey, casein, some breads, sausages, curry blocks, seasoning packets</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Tree nuts</td><td class="sev high">Allergic</td><td>Pesto, almond-based dairy-free cheese and dips (like Kite Hill), hazelnut spreads, nut flours</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Peanuts</td><td class="sev mid">Skin reactions</td><td>Kept out of every dish for now. Satay, kung pao, some frying oils</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Food coloring</td><td class="sev mid">Eczema</td><td>Red-dyed sauces like banana ketchup and jarred char siu, colored chips and candy</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Shellfish</td><td class="sev ok">Not allergic</td><td>Fine, but rarely cooked at home. Oyster sauce is allowed</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card" style="--pc: var(--sun)">
      <h2><span class="dot"></span>Mom</h2>
      <div class="tablewrap"><table class="allergy"><thead><tr><th>Allergen</th><th>Reaction</th><th>Notes</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody><tr><td>Dairy</td><td class="sev high">Allergic</td><td>Same hiding spots as milk above</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card" style="--pc: var(--wed)">
      <h2><span class="dot"></span>Jet, 5</h2>
      <div class="tablewrap"><table class="allergy"><thead><tr><th>Allergen</th><th>Reaction</th><th>Notes</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody><tr><td>Eggs</td><td class="sev mid">Itchy</td><td>Avoided at home and in his lunchbox</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Dairy</td><td class="sev mid">Itchy</td><td>Less strict, so he can try more foods</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h2>How the app keeps dinner safe</h2>
      <p class="fine" style="font-size:.95rem">Every dish leaves out fish, eggs, dairy, tree nuts and peanuts, and has no seafood, so all six of you eat the same dinner. Isla and Beckett can add cheese on the side when a recipe says so.</p>
      <p class="fine" style="font-size:.95rem">The app checks ingredients, not products. Brands change recipes and factory lines, so read every label, especially for fish and "may contain tree nuts".</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
<div class="toast" id="toast" hidden></div>

<script src="https://www.gstatic.com/firebasejs/10.12.2/firebase-app-compat.js"></script>
<script src="https://www.gstatic.com/firebasejs/10.12.2/firebase-firestore-compat.js"></script>
<script>
